WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
One early Buddhist verse is blunt.

2
00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:05.190
You yourself must make an effort.

3
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.680
The Buddhas are only preachers.

4
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:11.720
But other Buddhist texts say that
countless Buddhas teach right now,

5
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.500
in countless worlds.

6
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.260
So was the Buddha a
man who lived and died,

7
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.450
or something that never dies?

8
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.510
In this mission, you'll trace how the
idea of "Buddha" grew over the centuries.

9
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.110
Then you'll meet the
teaching of three bodies,

10
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.790
and weigh up whether it develops or
departs from the Buddha's own words.

11
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.230
Your mission: find out whether the
Buddha was a man who lived and died,

12
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.070
or something that never dies.
